---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About">
  <section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 md:py-16">
    <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6 sm:gap-10 mb-10">
      <div class="h-64 sm:h-80 md:h-96 rounded-2xl border border-white/25 overflow-hidden">
        <img
          src="/images/studio2.jpeg"
          alt="Working on a website design"
          class="w-full h-full object-cover"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="h-64 sm:h-80 md:h-96 rounded-2xl border border-white/25 overflow-hidden">
        <img
          src="/images/studio3.jpeg"
          alt="Laptop showing website code"
          class="w-full h-full object-cover"
        />
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/40 p-8 md:p-14 text-center md:text-left">
      <p class="uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-sm text-white/60 mb-4">
        About
      </p>

      <h1 class="text-4xl mb-6">About Harbour Web Studio</h1>

      <div class="text-white/85 leading-relaxed space-y-4 md:columns-2 md:gap-10">
        <p>
          Harbour Web Studio builds custom websites for Dublin's local businesses, the tradespeople,
          barbers, cafes and small businesses who deserve a proper online presence without having
          to pay agency prices for it.
        </p>

        <p>
          Loads of people can build a website. The real advantage here is being able to build
          something genuinely custom, designed specifically around your business, your customers
          and how you actually work, without the overheads that come with a big agency.
        </p>

        <p>
          Every project starts with understanding your business first: what you do, who your
          customers are, and what you need the site to actually achieve, whether that's more
          calls, more bookings, or simply looking credible when someone searches for you.
        </p>

        <p>
          From there, every site is built by hand rather than assembled from a generic template,
          so it looks and feels like it belongs to your business, not like it was picked off a shelf.
        </p>

        <p>
          The goal is simple: an affordable, professional website, built properly, delivered fast,
          and backed up with ongoing support if you need it.
        </p>

        <p>
          Custom Design • Mobile Responsive • Fast Turnaround • Local &amp; Affordable
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-white text-brand-500">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 text-center">
      <p class="uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-sm text-brand-500/70 mb-4">
        The Promise
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl mb-8">
        Custom-built, not templated
      </h2>

      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-left max-w-xl mx-auto">
        <div class="border border-brand-500/25 rounded-xl p-5">
          <p class="text-brand-500/85">
            A completely customised website designed around your business, not a one-size-fits-all
            template.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="border border-brand-500/25 rounded-xl p-5">
          <p class="text-brand-500/85">
            Affordable pricing built for local Dublin businesses, with no hidden extras.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
